{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starfly Scouts is a cozy multiplayer social game where you play as cute scout animals on an endless summer night. Catch fireflies, stargaze, chat with friends, complete quests, earn badges, and decorate your campsite in a peaceful multiplayer world made for relaxing together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> There\u2019s no combat, time limits, or pressure\u2014just a peaceful social space to relax and explore with others online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer social gameplay with up to 10 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firefly catching and stargazing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable characters and campsites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Badge collection and light quest progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chill, real-time chat in a persistent world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for low-pressure, relaxing sessions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740780?t=1748488819","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740780?t=1748488819","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740780/8723dec4963707ce2031579df663dcb51d2ce797/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748488819","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740780/8723dec4963707ce2031579df663dcb51d2ce797/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748488819","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starfly Scouts is a cozy multiplayer social game